From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] build_features: indicate CONFIG_INTERWORKING

A program that configures hostapd cannot tell whether the build holds
CONFIG_INTERWORKING, which SET_QOS_MAP_SET and SEND_QOS_MAP_CONF need.
Answer "interworking" in has_feature(), so that `hostapd -vinterworking`
tells it.

--- a/src/utils/build_features.h
+++ b/src/utils/build_features.h
@@ -69,6 +69,10 @@ static inline int has_feature(const char
 	if (!strcmp(feat, "dpp-map"))
 		return 1;
 #endif
+#ifdef CONFIG_INTERWORKING
+	if (!strcmp(feat, "interworking"))
+		return 1;
+#endif
 	return 0;
 }
 
